{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest Doesn\u2019t Care</strong> is an atmospheric exploration game about walking through the woods and picking mushrooms in a visually stunning, realistic environment. You are dropped into a true wild forest \u2014 no hints, no GPS, no goal except the one you set for yourself. Just you and the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/4eb1d7a03b48eeea30d8f64eb61ada73.poster.avif?t=1759903347\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/4eb1d7a03b48eeea30d8f64eb61ada73.webm?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/4eb1d7a03b48eeea30d8f64eb61ada73.mp4?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyper-realistic forest created from real-world terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and full day-night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/80d2bd19b9f2d07f319bd47ea51fc9cb.poster.avif?t=1759903347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/80d2bd19b9f2d07f319bd47ea51fc9cb.webm?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/80d2bd19b9f2d07f319bd47ea51fc9cb.mp4?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep ambient soundscape: rustling leaves, birdsong, distant unknowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushroom picking system with strange, mysterious discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow, meditative gameplay with no HUD, no stress, no rush</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.poster.avif?t=1759903347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.webm?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.mp4?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a game about achievements \u2014 it\u2019s a game about presence.<br>If you enjoy walking through forests, observing, listening, and occasionally discovering something unusual \u2014 <i>Forest Doesn\u2019t Care</i> was made for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>## Developer\u2019s Note</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is not just an atmospheric walk through the forest and mushroom collecting\u2014it is also an experiment with the modern capabilities of Unreal Engine 5. I used procedural generation, Nanite, Lumen, textures up to 8\u201316 K, and a vast amount of geometry to recreate the most alive and detailed nature.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a fully solo project made from scratch. For me, this game is proof that even one person can realize a dream using modern tools. If you\u2019ve ever dreamed of making games too\u2014don\u2019t be afraid, start making them!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Guitar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/98acb11456a8339f1d20d57deca61df7b9ca56a5.jpg"},{"name":"Big black bag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/3f22d37af307903868e71b580e42c26ac879b977.jpg"},{"name":"AK seventy-four...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/b780236d193e4339724c37fa7fc960c826a9c38b.jpg"},{"name":"Bathtub","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/7312dc35463f4e35de94c5075ddcf906c637f72c.jpg"},{"name":"Bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/dcec0f7e663f900c2ebf05450f62cb113f69ae48.jpg"},{"name":"KA52","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/aa2a6bb7a921b5b8b90b735306798e238fd1985c.jpg"},{"name":"MQReaper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/0b838d87974c18cad67ec1fb0fbc9010efdf4052.jpg"},{"name":"Stone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/85c7dd01590ecdcb812e7e240a0d5135d316a692.jpg"},{"name":"The Silent Chapel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/4470784c6613a52276515a97cb2b8415fce3b28c.jpg"},{"name":"Wallclock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/2365f41d7a73d3333af626b4eb52eb0d47856578.jpg"}],"total":46},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922100?t=1759903347","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/8e4e0ed4965c10b1280b9acd5f8dd80031b15031/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759903347","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/62e74a7e263824cfebc79da21c23b3bde8921561/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759903347","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/62e74a7e263824cfebc79da21c23b3bde8921561/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759903347","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>What Awaits You in the Next Update:</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/ecc99867333e460ae472cef112118874.avif?t=1759903347\" width=800 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you to everyone who has shown interest in our game \u2014 and a special thanks to those who have already purchased it!<br>We\u2019ve received hundreds of feedback messages on social media and plenty of new ideas, so we immediately started implementing your requests.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming very soon: a new version of the game featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camping</strong> \u2014 light fires and build small camps to stay warm at night or rest during the day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal changes</strong>: spring, summer, autumn, winter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic animals and predators</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved landscapes</strong> with rivers, swamps, roads, and trails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> supporting up to 10 players + voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outposts</strong>, where you can trade items and discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character selection</strong>, new animations, and improved movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimization</strong> and many more surprises!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning \u2014 even more exciting content is coming \ud83c\udf32\ud83c\udf44</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest Doesn\u2019t Care</strong> is an atmospheric exploration game about walking through the woods and picking mushrooms in a visually stunning, realistic environment. You are dropped into a true wild forest \u2014 no hints, no GPS, no goal except the one you set for yourself. Just you and the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/4eb1d7a03b48eeea30d8f64eb61ada73.poster.avif?t=1759903347\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/4eb1d7a03b48eeea30d8f64eb61ada73.webm?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/4eb1d7a03b48eeea30d8f64eb61ada73.mp4?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyper-realistic forest created from real-world terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and full day-night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/80d2bd19b9f2d07f319bd47ea51fc9cb.poster.avif?t=1759903347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/80d2bd19b9f2d07f319bd47ea51fc9cb.webm?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/80d2bd19b9f2d07f319bd47ea51fc9cb.mp4?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep ambient soundscape: rustling leaves, birdsong, distant unknowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushroom picking system with strange, mysterious discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow, meditative gameplay with no HUD, no stress, no rush</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.poster.avif?t=1759903347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.webm?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.mp4?t=1759903347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a game about achievements \u2014 it\u2019s a game about presence.<br>If you enjoy walking through forests, observing, listening, and occasionally discovering something unusual \u2014 <i>Forest Doesn\u2019t Care</i> was made for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>## Developer\u2019s Note</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is not just an atmospheric walk through the forest and mushroom collecting\u2014it is also an experiment with the modern capabilities of Unreal Engine 5. I used procedural generation, Nanite, Lumen, textures up to 8\u201316 K, and a vast amount of geometry to recreate the most alive and detailed nature.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a fully solo project made from scratch. For me, this game is proof that even one person can realize a dream using modern tools. If you\u2019ve ever dreamed of making games too\u2014don\u2019t be afraid, start making them!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MOROZ GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/10e09f5676ea9adce53c791ac0165bbd5239edf7/header.jpg?t=1759903347","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3922100/1585230821/25125e595e73c39124d0abe1686e9f31ebd136cc/1754210410/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754230665","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3922100/1585230821/25125e595e73c39124d0abe1686e9f31ebd136cc/1754210410/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754230665","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3922100/1585230821/25125e595e73c39124d0abe1686e9f31ebd136cc/1754210410/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754230665","id":257177495,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177495/movie480.mp4?t=1754230665","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177495/movie_max.mp4?t=1754230665"},"name":"Announcement Trailer | Forest Doesn\u2019t Care","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai